# Exact, opt-in IPv4 UDP request/response entries.
#
# Fields:
#   ingress_ifname server_ipv4 server_port request_hex response_hex lease_seconds
#
# Payloads are hexadecimal and must be at most 64 bytes. Use only deterministic,
# side-effect-free exchanges whose response is safe to synthesize. Unknown,
# expired, fragmented, malformed, or oversized traffic is passed to the normal
# network stack.

# Health probe: "ping" -> "pong-ok" for a backend reached through this TAP.
tap-example 192.0.2.53 9000 70696e67 706f6e672d6f6b 30
